# Production Environment Configuration
#
# 2026-08-31: VITE_API_URL / VITE_API_BASE_URL used to bake
# https://platform-api.quantix.com into every production bundle — a domain that does not
# exist. Values here are INLINED at build time and cannot be changed afterwards, so a
# published portal silently called a dead host.
#
# They are now EMPTY, which means "same origin": the SPA calls /api/v1/... on whatever
# origin serves it (correct when the API is reverse-proxied behind the same host).
# To point a build elsewhere, either:
#   1. edit /config.js in the published dist/ (runtime, no rebuild — preferred), or
#   2. set the vars in the shell before `npm run build` (they take precedence over this file).
VITE_API_URL=
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
VITE_MFA_ISSUER=Quantix Platform
VITE_APP_NAME=Quantix Platform Admin
VITE_MOCK_API=false
